; Expect: TextureWidth: the texture [0-9]+ does not exist
; A debug build (-d) stops TextureWidth on a texture that was freed. Other builds give 0.
If GetEnv$("BLITZLLVM_TEST_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("TextureWidth: the texture 1 does not exist (release build, not checked).")
tex = CreateTexture(8, 8, 1)
FreeTexture tex
Print TextureWidth(tex)
Print "TextureWidth did not stop the program."
